extend demo.pug 
block style 
    style 
        include ../static/style.css
        include ../static/about.css
block content 
    .para1
        p Welcome to XYZ Sarees, your trusted destination for exquisite sarees that blend tradition with modern elegance. At XYZ, we believe that a saree is more than just fabric—it's a symbol of grace, heritage, and timeless beauty. Our collection features handcrafted masterpieces, including luxurious Kanjeevaram, regal Banarasi, delicate Chanderi, and many more, catering to every occasion and style.
    .para1
        div 
            | Our Legacy   
        p Founded in 2k23, XYZ Sarees has been a pioneer in preserving India's rich textile heritage. Our journey began with a passion for fine craftsmanship, working closely with skilled artisans from across the country. Each saree in our collection is a testament to centuries-old weaving traditions, reimagined for the modern woman.
    .para1 
        div 
            | Why Choose XYZ Sarees?
        p i.Authentic & Handcrafted Designs – Sourced directly from master weavers.

        p ii.Premium Quality Fabrics – Pure silks, soft cottons, and intricate weaves.

        p iii.Exclusive & Custom Drapes – Unique designs you won’t find anywhere else.

        p iv.Sustainable & Ethical Fashion – Supporting artisans and eco-friendly production.

        p v.Worldwide Shipping – Bringing Indian heritage to your doorstep.
    .para1 
        div 
            |Our Sarees – A Story in Every Weave
        p From festive celebrations to bridal elegance, our sarees are designed to make every woman feel special. Whether you prefer timeless classics or contemporary styles, XYZ Sarees offers a range that suits every personality and occasion.